<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>出版物 |皮尤研究中心</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/publications/</link><description>塑造您世界的数字、事实和趋势</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:54:51 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>拉丁裔选民如何体验 2026 年中期选举</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/race-and-ethnicity/2026/10/16/how-latino-voters-are-experiencing-the-2026-midterm-elections/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/RE_2026.10.16_latino-voters_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;民主党国会候选人在拉丁裔登记选民中拥有相当大的优势。与四年前相比，拉丁裔民主党候选人支持者对今年选举的参与度更高。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:54:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/race-and-ethnicity/2026/10/16/how-latino-voters-are-experiencing-the-2026-midterm-elections/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能领域的性别差距</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/16/the-gender-gap-in-ai/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/PI_26.10.16_Chatbot-Gender_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;现在，男性和女性使用人工智能聊天机器人的比例相似，但男性使用频率更高，而女性则更怀疑人工智能对她们生活的影响。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:54:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/16/the-gender-gap-in-ai/</guid></item><item><title>共和党人对一些国家和国际组织的看法因年龄而存在很大差异</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/16/republicans-views-of-some-countries-and-international-organizations-differ-widely-by-age/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/SR_26.10.16_RepublicansForeignPolicy_featured.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;年轻的共和党人对某些国家和国际组织的看法有时比年长的共和党人更接近民主党的看法。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:54:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/16/republicans-views-of-some-countries-and-international-organizations-differ-widely-by-age/</guid></item><item><title>美国人对G20国家有何看法？</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/global/2026/10/16/how-do-americans-feel-about-g20-countries/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/PG_26.10.22_GlobalThermometers_featured@2x.png?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;在今年的G20峰会之前，大多数美国人对澳大利亚、加拿大、日本、意大利和其他成员国给予了热情的评价。对俄罗斯的情绪最为冷淡。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:54:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/global/2026/10/16/how-do-americans-feel-about-g20-countries/</guid></item><item><title>大多数美国人预计民主党将赢得众议院控制权；公众对参议院意见不一</title><link>https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/15/majority-of-americans-expect-democrats-to-win-control-of-house-public-is-split-on-senate/</link><description>&lt;img height="110" src="https://www.pewresearch.org/wp-content/uploads/sites/20/2026/10/SR_26.10.15_election-prediction_featured.jpg?w=194&amp;amp;h=110&amp;amp;crop=1" width="194" /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;p&gt;美国人总体上认为民主党赢得众议院多数席位的机会比控制参议院的机会更大。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; &lt;span style="font-size: 12px; color: gray;"&gt;（使用&lt;a href="https://fetchrss.com/feedLink?w=6a6d836405e2f22d650b3382" target="_blank"&gt;FetchRSS&lt;/a&gt;生成的提要）&lt;/span&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 01:54:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pewresearch.org/short-reads/2026/10/15/majority-of-americans-expect-democrats-to-win-control-of-house-public-is-split-on-senate/</guid></item></channel></rss>